{
  "sourceId": "post-Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors-zh-CN",
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵我们都经历过这种情况。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你打开一个测试文件，期待能理解代码的功能，结果却看到一个让你质疑一切的怪物。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "单元测试本应让我们的生活更轻松——它们记录行为、捕捉回归问题，并让我们有信心进行重构。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "但有时候，它们却变成了它们本该防止的东西：无法维护的噩梦。↵让我分享一些我在实际工作中遇到的最丑陋的单元测试。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "名字已经改变以保护有罪者，但恐怖是真实的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::danger{title=\"🔥 问题所在\"}↵这个测试违反了基本原则：一个测试，一个关注点。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当这个测试失败时，五种不同行为中的哪一个坏了？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你需要调试整个方法才能找出答案。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "测试变得相互依赖——如果用户创建失败，其他所有东西也会失败，隐藏了其他潜在的错误。↵**应该怎么做**：五个独立的测试，每个都有清楚的名称描述它验证什么。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当 testUserDeletion 失败时，你确切知道该看哪里。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::warning{title=\"⏰ 问题所在\"}↵基于时间的测试是不稳定的噩梦。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在快速的机器上，5 秒可能足够。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在负载下的慢速 CI 服务器上，可能不够。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "测试在本地通过但在生产环境中随机失败。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "开发人员开始忽略测试失败，因为\"又是那个不稳定的测试\"。↵**应该怎么做**：使用适当的同步机制——回调、promise 或带超时的轮询。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果可能的话，模拟异步行为。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "永远不要依赖任意的睡眠时间。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::bug{title=\"问题所在\"}↵大量重复使维护成为噩梦。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "需要改变用户对象结构？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 50 个地方更新它。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "设置代码比实际测试逻辑还长，将重要部分埋在噪音中。↵**应该怎么做**：提取测试固件，使用工厂函数，或利用测试设置方法。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "测试应该专注于使其独特的东西，而不是重复样板代码。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::question{title=\"问题所在\"}↵这些数字是什么意思？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "为什么 315 是预期结果？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "折扣是 10% 还是 0.1%？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当这个测试失败时，你会花 10 分钟用计算器算数学，然后才能开始调试。↵**应该怎么做**：使用命名常量或变量来解释计算。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "const decimal ITEM_PRICE = 100m; const int QUANTITY = 2; const decimal DISCOUNT_PERCENT = 10m; 现在测试自己记录自己。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::info{title=\"🤦 问题所在\"}↵这些测试验证 Java 的标准库是否正常工作。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "剧透：它确实正常。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Oracle 已经广泛测试了 ArrayList 和 HashMap。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这些测试增加零价值，同时增加维护负担和构建时间。↵**应该怎么做**：测试你的代码，而不是框架。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你没有添加任何业务逻辑，你不需要测试。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::tip{title=\"问题所在\"}↵只是重复代码所做的事情的注释是噪音。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它们不增加清晰度——它们增加混乱。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你的测试需要这么多注释才能理解，测试本身写得很差。↵**应该怎么做**：编写具有清楚变量名称和结构的自我记录代码。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用测试名称来描述正在测试什么。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "注释应该解释为什么，而不是什么。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::failure{title=\"问题所在\"}↵这个测试总是通过，因为它没有断言任何东西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是一种虚假的安全感。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "付款可能失败、抛出内部捕获的异常或返回错误——测试仍然是绿色的。↵**应该怎么做**：断言预期结果。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "付款成功了吗？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "数据库更新了吗？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用户收到确认了吗？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "没有断言的测试不是测试。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::warning{title=\"🎭 问题所在\"}↵你正在测试模拟返回你告诉它们返回的东西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这个测试对实际业务逻辑没有验证任何东西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它与现实如此隔离，以至于在生产代码完全损坏时它可能通过。↵**应该怎么做**：模拟外部依赖（数据库、API、文件系统），但不要模拟所有东西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "尽可能用真实对象测试真实逻辑。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "集成测试补充单元测试——两者都使用。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "↵:::danger{title=\"问题所在\"}↵跳过的测试是永远不会偿还的技术债务。\"稍后修复\"变成\"永远不修复\"。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这些测试腐烂，随着时间的推移变得更过时、更难修复。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "最终，没有人记得为什么它们被跳过或它们应该测试什么。↵**应该怎么做**：修复测试或删除它。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果它真的不稳定，使其确定性。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果它测试的东西不再重要，删除它。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "跳过的测试比没有测试更糟——它们给予虚假的信心。↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使这些测试丑陋的不仅仅是糟糕的风格——而是它们在测试的基本目的上失败了：提供代码正确工作的信心和它应该如何行为的文档。↵好的测试有共同的特征：↵**专注**：一个测试，一个行为。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当它失败时，你确切知道什么坏了。↵**可读**：测试名称和结构清楚地传达正在测试什么以及为什么。↵**确定性**：相同的输入，相同的输出，每次都是。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "没有不稳定性，没有随机性，没有时间依赖性。↵**快速**：测试应该在毫秒内运行，而不是秒。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "慢速测试不会被运行。↵**独立**：测试不依赖彼此或共享状态。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它们可以以任何顺序运行。↵**可维护**：当需求改变时，测试易于更新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "重复最小化。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你在这些例子中认出自己的代码，不要感到难过——我们都写过丑陋的测试。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "重要的是学习和改进。↵当你写下一个测试时，问问自己：↵如果这个测试在六个月后失败，我会理解为什么吗？↵我是在测试我的代码还是框架？↵我能删除一半的设置代码并仍然有一个有效的测试吗？↵这个测试给我信心代码能工作吗？↵单元测试是一项随着实践而提高的技能。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们今天写的丑陋测试教会我们明天写更好的测试。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "与你的团队分享你的测试恐怖故事。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "嘲笑它们。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从中学习。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "最重要的是，重构它们。↵因为唯一比丑陋测试更糟的是根本没有测试。↵:::success{title=\"✨ 一线希望\"}↵每个丑陋的测试都是学习的机会。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "代码审查捕捉这些问题。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors",
        "title": "丑陋的单元测试 - 测试恐怖故事集",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/Ugly-Unit-Tests-A-Collection-of-Testing-Horrors/"
      }
    },
    {
